# Invitations and Memberships (ticket 06). Log in first with http/auth.http and make a Tenant
# your Active Tenant with http/tenants.http; the Tenant Admin endpoints need a Tenant Admin token.
# Emails land in Mailpit (npm run mail:up, http://localhost:8025).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9800
@adminToken = paste-tenant-admin-access-token
@userToken = paste-invited-user-access-token
@tenantId = paste-tenant-id
@membershipId = paste-membership-id
@invitationId = paste-invitation-id
# From the Invitation email link: /invitation.html#token=<this>
@linkToken = paste-tenant-id.secret

### -------------------------------------------------------------- Tenant Admin: Invitations

### Invite an email address. 409 if it is already a member or already has a pending Invitation.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "new.person@example.com" }

### Pending Invitations (expired ones show expired: true until resent or cancelled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Resend with a new link and a fresh 7-day expiry. The old link stops working. 429 within a minute of the last send.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/invitations/{{invitationId}}/resend
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Cancel a pending Invitation (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/invitations/{{invitationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------- Tenant Admin: Memberships

### Every Membership in the Active Tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/memberships
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Give the Tenant Admin flag
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/memberships/{{membershipId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isTenantAdmin": true }

### Remove the Tenant Admin flag. 409 if it is the Tenant's last Tenant Admin.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/memberships/{{membershipId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isTenantAdmin": false }

### Remove a Membership (204). 409 for the last Tenant Admin.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/current/memberships/{{membershipId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------- The invited User

### Invitations inbox: pending, unexpired Invitations to your email
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/me/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Accept: creates your Membership (verified email needed). Then switch to the Tenant with tenants.http.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/me/invitations/{{invitationId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Decline (204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/me/invitations/{{invitationId}}/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Leave a Tenant yourself (204). 409 if you are its last Tenant Admin.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/membership
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------- The Invitation link (no account)

### Who the Invitation is from and for; hasAccount tells the page to offer login instead of signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/invitations/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{linkToken}}" }

### Sign up from the Invitation: the account starts verified and joins the Tenant. Then log in.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/invitations/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "{{linkToken}}", "firstName": "New", "lastName": "Person", "password": "correct horse battery staple" }
